title: Files whose folder and name have spaces and accents: the diff inside their cards, stage and unstage by path, one change staged from the card's menu, a file with no final newline staged by line, discard of the accented one; index must hold only line 2 of 'with space/a file.js' and the change of no_newline.txt
folders: git-spaces
expect-file: git-spaces/with space/a file.js :: ^export function hello\(name\) \{\n  return `hello \$\{name\}`;\n\}\n\nexport const more = 1;\n$
expect-file: git-spaces/año ñ/día €.txt :: ^uno\ndos\ntres\n$
expect-file: git-spaces/no_newline.txt :: ^one\nTWO$
forbid-log: script: ignoring
forbid-log: nothing offers

wait 3000
left changes
wait 500
diff on
wait 1500
mark 1-diff-on
wait 500
diff off
wait 1000
git stage with space/a file.js
wait 1200
git stage año ñ/día €.txt
wait 1200
mark 2-both-staged
wait 500
git unstage with space/a file.js
wait 1200
git unstage año ñ/día €.txt
wait 1200
part stage no_newline.txt 2
wait 1200
goto with space/a file.js
wait 1500
mark 3-card
wait 500
menu 900 290
wait 600
mark 4-menu
wait 500
ui click 1000 309
wait 1500
mark 5-staged-from-menu
wait 500
git discard año ñ/día €.txt
wait 600
mark 6-asked
wait 500
answer Discard
wait 1500
mark 7-end
wait 500
quit
